## Summary

I shipped a production-polished, native Apple (SwiftUI) parity of `web/src/lib/globalShortcuts.tsx` at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/misc-surfaces/globalShortcuts.*` and committed it (`dd26660f6`, clean tree).

**What I built (9 files, 1594 lines)** following the canonical leaf pattern — pure `Adapter` (a verbatim port of the web `defs`: 4 universals + 14 `GOTO_SHORTCUTS` + 3 `commandRegistry` shortcut entries = 21, with key-token model, grouping, a11y), `Model` (P1/S8 state-holder seam, P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, P1/S10 i18n facade, connection axis + one-shot stale auto-refresh, canonical + in-memory sources), the `GlobalShortcuts` view + Views/States (reusing `TSCode`/`TSCard`/`TSEmptyState` and P1/S9 tokens), Previews, a `globalShortcuts` strings table, and Tests/ModelTests.

